              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Richard L. Wilson, wilson argues the regulation is content neutral on its face, though it may allow viewpoint\u2011based decisions."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Richard L. Wilson",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "8708306d364a0a971afed91c1011343d545f4ef879a130213cde71fce69f3373",
