              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 9,
                "start": 9
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Richard L. Wilson, the ordinance functions as a prior restraint on speech."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Wilson",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "8708306d364a0a971afed91c1011343d545f4ef879a130213cde71fce69f3373",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-8708306d364a-0001-0000"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 21,
                "start": 21
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Wilson, wilson contends the ordinance permits inappropriate, content\u2011based, or viewpoint\u2011based decisions behind closed doors, even if not authorized on its face."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Wilson",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "8708306d364a0a971afed91c1011343d545f4ef879a130213cde71fce69f3373",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-8708306d364a-0002-0003"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 52,
                "start": 52
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Wilson, wilson argues the current permit process lacks a meaningful administrative procedure and creates unnecessary litigation."
        }
      ],
