              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Strauss, the park district uses a first\u2011come\u2011first\u2011serve rule in its permit process."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Strauss",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "8708306d364a0a971afed91c1011343d545f4ef879a130213cde71fce69f3373",
              "evidence_ids": [
