              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 31,
                "start": 31
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Strauss, when a permit is denied, the notice must clearly state the grounds for denial."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Strauss",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "8708306d364a0a971afed91c1011343d545f4ef879a130213cde71fce69f3373",
